oray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3381192925","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111401#issuecomment-3381192925","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111401","id":3381192925,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7JiOjd","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-08T12:03:02Z","updated_at":"2025-10-08T12:03:02Z","body":"In my experience most users who make those kinds of reports don't read the documentation or search the forums etc. anyway so I don't think this will help for those cases","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3381192925/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3381671280","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111401#issuecomment-3381671280","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111401","id":3381671280,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7JkDVw","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-08T13:56:24Z","updated_at":"2025-10-08T13:56:24Z","body":"Can you check and share the JSON for the RTSS Vulkan implicit layer? Should be listed in the registry in `Computer\\HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SOFTWARE\\Khronos\\Vulkan\\ImplicitLayers ` or similar.\n\n> 4.4.2.rc\n\nWhich commit exactly? The actual HEAD commit of the `4.2` branch explicitly tries to address this: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/46f16271e24f20a47400232ac86f3f6ee5664007","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3381671280/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3383389291","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111401#issuecomment-3383389291","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111401","id":3383389291,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Jqmxr","user":{"login":"KnightNine","id":34152090,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0MTUyMDkw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34152090?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KnightNine","html_url":"https://github.com/KnightNine","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KnightNine/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KnightNine/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KnightNine/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KnightNine/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KnightNine/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KnightNine/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KnightNine/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KnightNine/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KnightNine/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-08T22:00:46Z","updated_at":"2025-10-08T22:18:08Z","body":"@akien-mga \n\nI already uninstalled RTSS. hold up I'll install it again.\n\nNot sure which exact commit i downloaded, but I downloaded it on 10-06.\n\nI can confirm that main.cpp has this code in it:\n```\n#ifdef TOOLS_ENABLED\n\tif (!project_manager && !editor) {\n\t\t// If we didn't find a project, we fall back to the project manager.\n\t\tproject_manager = !found_project && !cmdline_tool;\n\t}\n\n\t{\n\t\t// Synced with https://github.com/baldurk/renderdoc/blob/2b01465c7/renderdoc/driver/vulkan/vk_layer.cpp#L118-L165\n\t\tLocalVector<String> layers_to_disable = {\n\t\t\t\"DISABLE_RTSS_LAYER\", // GH-57937.\n\t\t\t\"DISABLE_VULKAN_OBS_CAPTURE\", // GH-103800.\n\t\t\t\"DISABLE_VULKAN_OW_OBS_CAPTURE\", // GH-104154.\n\t\t\t\"DISABLE_SAMPLE_LAYER\", // GH-104154.\n\t\t\t\"DISABLE_GAMEPP_LAYER\", // GH-104154.\n\t\t\t\"DISABLE_VK_LAYER_TENCENT_wegame_cross_overlay_1\", // GH-104154.\n\t\t\t// \"NODEVICE_SELECT\", // Kept as it's useful - GH-104592.\n\t\t\t\"VK_LAYER_bandicam_helper_DEBUG_1\", // GH-101480.\n\t\t\t\"DISABLE_VK_LAYER_bandicam_helper_1\", // GH-101480.\n\t\t\t\"DISABLE_VK_LAYER_reshade_1\", // GH-70849.\n\t\t\t\"DISABLE_VK_LAYER_GPUOpen_GRS\", // GH-104154.\n\t\t\t\"DISABLE_LAYER\", // GH-104154 (fpsmon).\n\t\t\t\"DISABLE_MANGOHUD\", // GH-57403.\n\t\t\t\"DISABLE_VKBASALT\",\n\t\t};\n```","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3383389291/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3383430110","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111401#issuecomment-3383430110","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111401","id":3383430110,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Jqwve","user":{"login":"KnightNine","id":34152090,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0MTUyMDkw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34152090?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KnightNine","html_url":"https://github.com/KnightNine","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KnightNine/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KnightNine/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KnightNine/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KnightNine/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KnightNine/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KnightNine/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KnightNine/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KnightNine/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KnightNine/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-08T22:21:51Z","updated_at":"2025-10-08T22:21:51Z","body":"@akien-mga \nHere is the RTSSVkLayer64.json:\n```\n{\n  \"file_format_version\" : \"1.0.0\",\n  \"layer\" : {\n    \"name\": \"VK_LAYER_RTSS\",\n    \"type\": \"GLOBAL\",\n    \"library_path\": \".\\\\RTSSVkLayer64.dll\",\n    \"api_version\": \"1.3.224\",\n    \"implementation_version\": \"1\",\n    \"description\": \"RTSS overlay hook bootstrap\",\n    \"functions\": {\n      \"vkGetInstanceProcAddr\": \"RTSSVkLayer_GetInstanceProcAddr\",\n      \"vkGetDeviceProcAddr\": \"RTSSVkLayer_GetDeviceProcAddr\"\n    },\n    \"disable_environment\": {\n      \"DISABLE_RTSS_LAYER\": \"1\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n```","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3383430110/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3383508694","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111401#issuecomment-3383508694","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111401","id":3383508694,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7JrD7W","user":{"login":"KnightNine","id":34152090,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0MTUyMDkw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34152090?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KnightNine","html_url":"https://github.com/KnightNine","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KnightNine/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KnightNine/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KnightNine/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KnightNine/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KnightNine/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KnightNine/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KnightNine/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KnightNine/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KnightNine/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-08T23:07:08Z","updated_at":"2025-10-08T23:07:56Z","body":"> Come on, it is 2025, the world has internet, people can find that info in less time than the tool download if they care to search for any info at all. RivaTuner is a well known process injector that fills the entire internet search engines with issue pages, it is basically the poster child and encyclopedia entry for unstable.\n\nThe youtube installation tutorial didn't inform me that was the case, and I would've gone on never knowing that this was the case until an issue such as this brought it to my attention.  I only found out since I knew Godot was working on my system before and could retrace my steps; I'm not sure how long i would be searching for a fix if that wasn't the case, and I had to take shots in the dark trying to figure out what was causing \"MEMORY_CORRUPTION_LARGE_c0000005_memory_corruption!D3D12Core.dll\".  Maybe not that long but maybe longer.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3383508694/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]